window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"heimerdinger","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Skill","Skill","Heimerdinger","Zaahen"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 2-3","text":"His Q is single-target; only Aureate Rush reaches the nest, and it is down 10s after he uses it."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"UPGRADE!!! plus the grenade stun makes his dives punishable — your best defensive spike."},{"when":"2+ items","text":"He outclasses the nest 1v1 — turret your team's fights, not the side lane."},{"text":"Grim Deliverance heals him for a portion of the damage it deals, and a full Determination passive lets him revive — Oblivion Orb before you commit, or you kill him twice and get neither.","when":"First item"}],"wants":{"you":["Turrets rebuilt faster than his clears","A stun the moment he commits","Five-man fights around your nest"],"foe":["Cleared nests, then the walk-down","Brawls with you off your setup","Side-lane juggernaut scaling"]},"early":"The Darkin Glaive is a single-target auto reset, not a cleave — the ability that actually reaches your nest is Aureate Rush (E), and it is down 10s at rank 1. Hold the grenade for his landing, kite back, re-nest on cooldown, and poke with rockets from behind the next line. Levels 4-5 stabilise because a full nest holds his engage again.","mid":"Level 6 gives you real teeth — an UPGRADE!!! turret plus the grenade stun makes every dive punishable, and a stunned Zaahen inside the nest melts. His Q and his ultimate both heal him, so buy Oblivion Orb before any extended trade or he wins the attrition. Shove with rockets, take plates while he re-approaches, and never brawl off the nest.","late":"Two-plus items his juggernaut scaling and gap-close simply outclass a lone turret nest, so stop offering him the side-lane duel. Group, plant the nest at chokepoints and objectives, and let his engage eat a stun in front of five people. You lose the 1v1 chapter of this game — so win the siege and teamfight chapters instead, where the nest still rules.","whys":["Level 1 is even — pure last-hitting before his cleave can threaten your turrets.","Level 2 is yours: The Darkin Glaive is a single-target auto reset, so two H-28G turrets out-chip anything he can do without spending his dash.","Level 3 stays his — Golden Onslaught engages beat your immobile kit once the nest is thinned.","Levels 4-5 even out: a full turret zone holds his engage at bay before his ult can fully commit.","Level 6 is even — your UPGRADE!!! turret plus the grenade stun punishes any sloppy all-in he tries.","First item is yours — Liandry's plus a full nest out-damages his sustain, provided you bought Oblivion Orb and fight on top of the turrets.","2+ items stays his — juggernaut scaling and gap-close outclass turrets alone; you need your team and terrain."]});
