window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"heimerdinger","b":"masteryi","win":["Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Heimerdinger","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-3","text":"Grenade his Meditate channel and the 10s heal is cancelled outright."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"Highlander is 85s and makes every slow you own useless."},{"when":"Enemy 2+ items","text":"Wuju Style's true damage cuts turrets regardless of build — end it first."},{"text":"Alpha Strike is 20s at rank 1 and it goes UNTARGETABLE mid-dash — never throw the grenade at the dive itself, throw it where he lands. His basic attacks shorten that 20s, so count his autos on the wave.","when":"Every Alpha Strike"}],"wants":{"you":["A starved Yi for six full stages","Grenade stuns on every Alpha dive","The game closed before his 2-item spike"],"foe":["Any early farm at all","Survival to full crit","Highlander's 85s slow immunity"]},"early":"You are his nightmare for six straight stages: Q turrets zone him off the wave from level 1, Micro-Rockets chunk every approach, and Alpha Strike is 20s at rank 1 — one dodged dive strands him inside the nest. Meditate is a channel, so a grenade stun cancels the 10s heal outright. Starve him: every CS he misses delays the only phase he can win.","mid":"Level 6 and first item deepen his misery — UPGRADE!!! super-turrets or rocket waves delete dives, and every Meditate he channels to survive is a 10s heal your grenade cancels. Convert hard: shove, poke, call your jungler for lane-locked kills, and translate total lane dominance into map objectives before his item timeline ever matters.","late":"Only at two-plus items with Highlander does he finally burst through the turret field — so make sure the game is already decided. Push objectives hard through the mid game and end. If it does go late, fight grouped: nest at objectives and hold the STUN for his engage — Highlander makes him immune to every slow you own, so the grenade's centre is the only thing that stops him.","whys":["Level 1 is Heimerdinger — Q turrets zone him off the wave from the very first minion.","Level 2 stays yours: turret plus Micro-Rocket poke shuts his lane down completely.","Level 3 is yours — Alpha Strike is 20s, so one dodged dive leaves him in the nest with nothing.","Levels 4-5 stay Heimerdinger — the turret field out-damages anything he attempts.","Level 6 is yours — but Highlander makes him slow-immune, so only your stun holds him.","First item stays Heimerdinger: your siege and stun keep him behind — keep denying.","2+ items finally goes to Master Yi — full crit plus Wuju Style true damage burns the turrets down, so group up."]});
